cff-version: 1.2.0
title: healpix-connector
message: >-
  If you use healpix-connector, please cite it using the metadata in this file.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Fouilloux
    given-names: Anne
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1784-2920
    affiliation: LifeWatch ERIC
repository-code: https://github.com/annefou/healpix-connector
abstract: >-
  Connects existing data repositories (GBIF, OBIS, Living Atlases, STAC
  sources) to the HEALPix discrete global grid used by GRID4EARTH, returning
  every value with its declared support, valid time, uncertainty and
  provenance.
keywords:
  - HEALPix
  - DGGS
  - biodiversity
  - GBIF
  - OBIS
  - data fusion
  - GRID4EARTH
